"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Horst Maier</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Associate, Compensation &amp; Benefits</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Distinguished Engineer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Stephen Bose</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Digital Transformation</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Retirement Plan Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Aroha Ibeh</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Program Manager</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Supplier Representative</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Relocation Policy Update for Remote Workforce</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Relocation Policy Update for Remote Workforce was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with the Lobbying Disclosure Act. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s lobbying activities and confirmed that they were in compliance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Dividend Policy Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">{chair} presented the {item_title} for committee review. The analysis, prepared by ACPWB engagement team, covered {n} employee records across {regions} organizational units. Discussion focused on variance from prior-year benchmarks and alignment with the {industry} peer group. Members raised questions regarding methodology and timeline for implementation. {chair} noted that all supporting documentation is available as Exhibit {exhibit} in the meeting materials.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for vision:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Sustainability and Corporate Responsibility Committee approves the annual budget for the Dividend Policy Review in the amount of $36M for fiscal year 2017.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> William Mekonnen &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Tariq Sanford</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Healthcare Cost Containment Initiative Update</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee reviewed the quarterly performance metrics related to the Healthcare Cost Containment Initiative Update. Tariq Sanford reported that all KPIs were within the target range, with the exception of a 5% shortfall in the 17 region. A plan to address this regional variance was requested for the next meeting.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To appoint:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Sustainability and Corporate Responsibility Committee determines that the compensation for the Named Executive Officers for fiscal year 2017 is reasonable and in the best interests of the company and its shareholders.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Tariq Sanford &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> William Mekonnen</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Meet with institutional investors to discuss the company&#x27;s position on Relocation Policy Update for Remote Workforce</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Gianfranco Alemu</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2017-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a presentation on the company&#x27;s talent retention strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Lucia Clark</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2017-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Evaluate the effectiveness of the company&#x27;s whistleblower hotline</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Yeonwoo Hubbard</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2017-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Analyze the ROI of the company&#x27;s leadership development programs</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Mae Persson</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2017-06-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 5:45 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2017-06-17</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Aroha Ibeh</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Program Manager, Supplier Representative</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bo